# Day 38 Reflection

Today I learned that responding to an incident is just as important as preventing one.

The biggest lesson was understanding the six phases of the Incident Response lifecycle and how each phase contributes to minimizing damage and restoring business operations. I also learned the importance of preserving digital evidence through the Chain of Custody and how IoCs and IoAs help analysts detect and investigate attacks.

A strong Incident Response process can significantly reduce the impact of cyber incidents.
